      "objective": "Test whether one local interval changes individual or representative geometry.",
      "estimator": "For each pair and the baseline and omission medians, absolute difference between pre/post unsigned rotation angle (degree) or pre/post RMSD (angstrom).",
      "training_data_lineage": "Deterministic coordinate analysis of one deposited asymmetric unit."
    },
